# Line endings: Git stores LF and checks files out with LF on every system, so a Windows
# checkout and the Linux CI machine see identical files (and Prettier's "endOfLine": "lf"
# agrees). Why: docs/wiki/decisions.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary files: never touch their bytes (no line-ending conversion, no text diff).
*.ico binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.pdf binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
